# i18n Phase 2 warm-script byproducts.
# i18n-chrome-capture.jsonl is written by the build when
# I18N_CAPTURE_CHROME_STRINGS=1 (src/lib/t.ts) so scripts/translate-warm.mjs
# can discover chrome strings that source-parsing cannot see (brief
# Implementation note D). It is a ~1MB regenerable artifact, never input to
# a build. The bulk-put files are transient wrangler payloads.
i18n-chrome-capture.jsonl
.translate-warm-bulk-put.json*
